            <draw name="BalanceConfirmation" w="6.899806in">
               <ui>
                  <textEdit/>
               </ui>
               <value>
                  <exData xmlns:xft-xliff="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-xliff/1.0/" contentType="text/html" maxLength="0" xft-xliff:id="N6195" xliff:rid="N6195">
                     <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="2.7.0.0"><p style="font-weight:bold">Balance confirmation for<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField018467" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/>.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Dear Sir/Madam,<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>As part of the audit of our year-end closing, please compare the open items listed in the itemization<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField029358" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/> with your books and confirm your agreement with the balance on the last page of this letter by<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField026962" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/>. If differences are found after the audit, please advice us of this, so that the causes of the differences can be determined.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>Please use the enclosed franked envelope for your reply and include an explanation of the differences.</p><p><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p>We thank you in advance for doing so as soon as possible.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p></body>
                  </exData>
               </value>
               <font typeface="Arial"/>
               <margin bottomInset="0mm" leftInset="0mm" rightInset="0mm" topInset="0mm"/>
               <para vAlign="middle"/>
               <assist>
                  <speak disable="1"/>
               </assist>
            </draw>
            <field access="readOnly" h="9mm" id="floatingField016827" name="ABSTIDAT03" presence="hidden" w="62mm">
               <ui>
